latentCreate ships no AI models and performs no inference. Music, lyric, and
image generation are delegated at runtime to software and services the user
installs or subscribes to (ComfyUI over its own HTTP API, LLM providers).
Models and weights obtained through this application carry their own licenses,
which the user is responsible for reviewing and complying with.

The third-party software this application is built from, and its licenses, are
listed in THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md.
